Subject: [PATCH 214/307] !F (Terrain Integration) Add per-instance slope,
 blend and height parameters.

Store slope limit, transition width and height band on each brush and preserve
them when an entity slot recreates its render node. Defaults retain the
existing unrestricted integration behaviour.
