 Code/CryEngine/CryEntitySystem/Entity.h       |  2 +
 Code/CryEngine/CryEntitySystem/EntitySlot.cpp | 41 +++++++++++++++++++
 Code/CryEngine/CryEntitySystem/EntitySlot.h   | 12 ++++++
 7 files changed, 129 insertions(+)

